<title>FRANCE: Bancaire maintains profitability forecast.</title>
<headline>Bancaire maintains profitability forecast.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compagnie Bancaire on Thursday re-affirmed its objective of reaching a return on shareholders funds of at least 10 percent from 1997 while the medium-term goal was to obtain a figure of 15 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;We have a high profitability goal, of at least 10 percent from 1997. It's an intermediate objective that seems attainable to us,&quot; chairman Bernard Mueller told a news conference.</p>
<p>He added that he was confident the medium-term goal of 15 percent was within reach. &quot;I have no worries about the 15 percent,&quot; he said, adding he wanted to reach it &quot;as soon as possible, in less than five years.&quot;</p>
</text>
